@local/dsh-rtl-bidi README · What it does：Only transcript and Markdown surfaces are affected (`[data-chat-flow]`,
`[class*="_markdown_"]`); sidebars, settings and other chrome keep their LTR
layout.

@local/dsh-rtl-bidi README · Before / after：Left: the current behaviour — Persian lines left-aligned, markers on the left,
quote bar on the left, mixed lines out of order. Right: the same document with
this bundle installed.

@local/dsh-rtl-bidi README · Verifying the rendering：`--dump-dom` on the same URL shows the pinned blocks:
`data-dsh-dir="rtl"` on Persian blocks, `data-dsh-dir="ltr"` on English ones,
and no attribute on blocks that only contain digits or punctuation.
